#ASSERT `By what date must my employer offer me re-employment` (Date 1 1 1960) 63 65 EQUALS JUST (Date 31 12 2024)
#ASSERT `By what date must my employer offer me re-employment` (Date 1 1 1960) 0 0 EQUALS NOTHING
