#ASSERT `Is my employer's obligation to re-employ me on foot` (Date 1 1 1960) 63 0 68 No No (Date 1 1 2025) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Is my employer's obligation to re-employ me on foot` (Date 1 1 1960) 63 0 0 Yes No (Date 1 1 2025) EQUALS NOTHING
