#ASSERT `Are my accrued rights affected if I work on` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Are my accrued rights affected if I work on` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
