#ASSERT `Must the Minister have regard to the consideration` `the tripartite guidelines` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `May the Minister have regard to the consideration` `the tripartite guidelines` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `May the Minister have regard to the consideration` `the employee's age` EQUALS NOTHING
-- s 8(5) and 8B(11): final
#ASSERT `Is the Minister's decision final` `My dismissal on the ground of age, under section 8` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
